{"id":"propo_sito","lemma":"propósito","pos":"noun","rank":701,"glosses":["purpose; target; aim; goal","purpose; motive (reason for which something is done)"],"ipa":"/pɾoˈpɔ.zi.tu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/36/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-prop%C3%B3sito.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-prop%C3%B3sito.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"propósitos"},"examples":[{"text":"A que propósito?","en":"For what purpose?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67621","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"that / what"},null]},{"text":"Com que propósito ele veio aqui?","en":"For what purpose did he come here?","words":[{"g":"with"},{"g":"that / what"},null,{"g":"he"},{"g":"to come","l":"vir"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Eu fiz de propósito.","en":"I did it on purpose.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/495033","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"A propósito, onde você mora?","en":"By the way, where do you live?","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"where"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to live, reside","l":"morar"}]},{"text":"Ele me deixou esperando de propósito.","en":"He kept me waiting on purpose.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to leave","l":"deixar"},{"g":"to wait","l":"esperar"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}